	(text "1. Thermal vias under TP4056 charger IC\n2. Add a lowpass filter to CONFIG input\n3. Add solderpads for connecting a power switch\n4. Add BUTTONS_POWER_ON signal to pin 6 of\nprogramming interface to keep device on during\ndebugging\n5. Replace or add 10-pin 0.05\" Samtec FTSH \nconnector for debug connection\n6. Use LDO_IN switched VBat for battery\nmeasurements, get rid of two mosfets\n7. Add VBUS adc reading to detect charger\n8. Add fourth button input"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 227.584 140.716 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
